{title: 401 - In Imitation, Lord of Thee}
{artist: Seventh-day Adventist Hymnal}
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: F}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{tag: Doctrines}
{tag: }

Verse 1:
[F]In imitation, Lord, of Thee,
[C]This solemn service we [F]repeat;
[F]For Thine example full of grace,
[Bb]Has made [F]this humble duty [C]sweet.

Verse 2:
[F]Renew each sacred spark of love,
[C]And vitalize the holy [F]flame;
[F]May union strong our hearts unite
[Bb]While [F]this we do in Jesus' [C]name.

Verse 3:
[F]Our great example Thou shalt be,
[C]In washing Thy disciples [F]feet;
[F]And as we follow Thy command,
[Bb]Make Thou [F]our fellowship complete.
